        "chars": 364,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 275.55
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        162,
        815,
        1225,
        953
      ],
      "category": "List-item",
      "text": "(ii) Determine and review short-range and long-range goals in the delivery of health care services, including the determination, in cooperation with the District Boards referred to in section 6 below, of unmet health needs and priorities as to the allocation of health resources.",
